Fix silently dropped properties whose quoted parameter values contain an escaped double quote, e.g. ``ATTENDEE;CN="Qu\"ote":mailto:x@y.z``. ``\"`` inside a quoted parameter value is now treated as a literal quote (:rfc:`2445`-style escaping found in real-world files) instead of closing the quoted section, which made the value-separating colon look quoted and the whole content line vanish from the parsed component. An escaped quote counts as content only while value text follows it: a ``\"`` right before a parameter delimiter or at the end of the value reads as a literal backslash plus the closing quote, the same shape icalendar itself writes for parameter values ending in a backslash. I used AI to assist me with this change. @Pushpak731
